 sigil alias, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigil_alias_tip reverse check that runs the whole rewrite pipeline, emit[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tip and alias JSON from capture-rewrite, and pin it with round-trip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]negative, and CLI tests plus docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Portable tip model, policy, and ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-tip-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-tip-core: decode the new capture-rewrite fields in CaptureCore and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the lesson map, presentation strings, the pure fade-by-fluency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]policy, session rules, and the UserDefaults JSON ledger with weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, all unit-tested.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Trigger, tip lane, and the completion-list host[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-completion-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-alias-tips, mac-tip-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-completion-tips: record physically Shift- or Option-typed @ and # [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigils, run the non-blocking alias-tip lane, admit tips only in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list's first frame, count adoption and escapes, add the Settings toggle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and reset, pin the shared tip row in CompletionList, and add the Typing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tips docs page.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The picker host for the remaining lessons[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-picker-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-completion-tips[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-picker-tips: widen the trigger to ^ : + ~ & *, admit tips in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picke